{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_title", "source_sha256": "3c11c6997d2af40f8048049e6301d6df853736040f3683cde2716942c6844a14", "ja": "可奈とおでかけ2", "zh": "和可奈出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2f638171690c6781e6556439e1fe5bab3a342b62a78acfea28d4fb2a7aa55a3f", "ja": "可奈とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和可奈出门外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "465dd280e1b205ed26cefa1ef0ac13798175e29b7f01757e4007a442f4f68180", "ja": "（長野で少し時間ができたので、可奈とピクニックに\n来た。天気も良くて、清々しい陽気だ）", "zh": "（在长野有了一点空闲时间，所以和可奈一起来野餐了。\n天气也很好，真是清爽宜人的好天气啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "02773ca8e7babb268b4a13738ebd660cf408f60ff79623ae91f25fe5915c5eef", "ja": "やっほ～♪　はいほ～♪　やまびこ、ぱお～ん♪", "zh": "呀吼～♪　嗨吼～♪　回音，哞——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a74dfd2129ebb54eabd229d5e39c06008bb35c69cb825f6aeebd12244ba9608a", "ja": "やまびこが、ぱお～ん？　\nどういうやまびこなんだ……。", "zh": "回声还会“呜呜”叫？\n这到底算是什么回声啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "4da7ebf25837559b2a6d6ae0ed3f66d138bdaf520b9c7fc8703956018f1d98bb", "ja": "わかんないです！　なんか楽しくて、\n可奈もぱお～ん♪なんです！　えへっ♪", "zh": "我也不知道！就觉得好开心，\n可奈也啪嗷～♪了一声！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d9e734629636d1643bf2f92f30eaabfea5bdf673b293c33ef0786269fef7d3da", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n可奈がご機嫌なのは、よくわかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n我很清楚，可奈现在心情很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "bdd9d231fa53e9c9d1571d7a2ddb6cf0ce6b160d72bb1991443b2e05adaa56aa", "ja": "{$P$}さんっていっつも、\n私のことわかってくれるから、す……はっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生总是很懂我，\n所以我最喜……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "1a2293855b3731ad3e534ceaf74646cf7b93192f9491f9eb8f416f9ceed01c2f", "ja": "えっと、えっと……す、素敵だな～！？って！\nえへへへへ……。", "zh": "那个，那个……我、我是说，很棒啊～！？  \n欸嘿嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "e401c597442de1e7ad2c7db400e88900a59271e92aaf406718697c7bcab3cfd2", "ja": "素敵だな～♪　……長野の冬は、スキー！\nスキーも、行っきたっい、なー！", "zh": "真棒啊～♪……长野的冬天，就是滑雪！我也好想去滑雪啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4559b41dfd100761c60c3297d4243c0730b3e4e6391c1f876d267161f5e823f1", "ja": "スキーもいいな。\n可奈は、スキーが好きなのか？", "zh": "滑雪也不错嘛。\n可奈喜欢滑雪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f2beb29011439f811c484805d8a0e0b6842dfda0f71f1b28db406fea3ebb0d20", "ja": "すっ……！？", "zh": "滑……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "bfb3eaf773a7690b5e6ce4a162c508dcf86c365e74922ae95b835ec02a804c4a", "ja": "す、好きです！　スキーが！　スキーが好きですー！\nスキーも……好き。えへへっ。えへ♪", "zh": "我、我喜欢！喜欢滑雪！我喜欢滑雪——！\n滑雪也……喜欢。嘿嘿。诶嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2af79f404d74645d4b428ea7f2a479fb2c4018e45d57c94ca86ca667fcd3e0fc", "ja": "（今日の可奈は、すごく楽しそうだ。いい景色だから\n心も晴れるんだろう。連れてきてよかったな！）", "zh": "（今天的可奈看起来特别开心。景色这么美，她的心情也会变好吧。还好带她来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
